@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
title Phase 1 final - observed dependency direction (not Phase 2)
component "Main\n--box opt-in" as Main
component "CLI\nCommandFactory/Dispatcher" as CLI
component "application\nEditor, command objects, history" as App
component "domain\nShapeFactory, ShapeProvider, model" as Domain
component "infrastructure\nSvgCodec, NodeDocumentStore" as Infra
component "optional plugin\nBoxProvider, Box" as Box
Main --> CLI
Main --> App
Main --> Domain
Main --> Infra
Main --> Box : if --box
CLI --> App
App --> Domain
Infra --> Domain
Infra --> App : DocumentPort
Box --> Domain
note bottom of CLI
  Built-in command registrations live in CommandFactory's constructor.
  No separately verified AttributeHandler / TreeDecorator or config loader.
end note
@enduml
